size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260512/zhanbao_image_1741472_1778534148_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260512/zhanbao_image_1741472_1778534148_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>帕夫利季斯点射绝平，拉法·席尔瓦破门；本菲卡积77分排在第三，落后葡萄牙体育2分，布拉加积58分排名第四。</p><p><strong>【热门新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-12/6a02451076a0cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">4轮不败！英超积分榜：热刺剩两轮领先西汉姆2分，净胜球多11个</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.36" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260512/202605120508149609.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.36" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.36" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260512/202605120508149609_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260512/202605120508149609_720.jpg"> </div><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-12/6a0245958aa1cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">乱！意甲积分：那不勒斯输球仅领先第5名3分，第2至第6都仍在争四</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.36" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260512/202605120510195264.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.36" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.36" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260512/202605120510195264_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260512/202605120510195264_720.jpg"> </div><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-12/6a020aa0e331fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">玻璃心？TA：姆巴佩因多次在伯纳乌被嘘，不愿本季再在伯纳乌登场</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.77" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260416/69e032506f179.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.77" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.77" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260416/69e032506f179.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260416/69e032506f179.jpg"> </div><p>据The Athletic从皇马内部消息人士获悉，姆巴佩因多次在伯纳乌球场遭到球迷嘘声，他本人不愿本赛季再在伯纳乌登场比赛。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-12/6a020b81775eenative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">英超本赛季公平竞赛榜：阿森纳领跑，热刺蓝军破百成“最脏”两队</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260512/202605120112216797.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260512/202605120112216797.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260512/202605120112216797.jpg"> </div><p>德转一项统计，以积分规则排列出了本赛季至今的英超公平竞赛榜单，算法为加分制，黄牌1分，两黄变一红3分，直红5分。总分越低排名越高。上图第四栏为红牌总数，只作统计用，不影响算分。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-12/6a0222a50f04bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">杀人诛心！亚马尔展示球衣：谢天谢地，我不是马德里主义者</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260512/202605120407537701.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260512/202605120407537701.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260512/202605120407537701.jpg"> </div><p>巴萨夺冠巡游，亚马尔在大巴上亮出球衣，球衣上印着：“谢天谢地，我不是马德里主义者。”，并配合舞蹈。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-12/6a0253bf102cdnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">TA跟队：皇马私下议论82的做派不配当队长；他一整年都是这种状态</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260511/6a00af033a967.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260511/6a00af033a967.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260511/6a00af033a967.jpg"> </div><p>TA皇马跟队记者Mario Cortegana做客IÑAKI ANGULO TV直播间，并在直播中透露了皇马队内训练中，巴尔韦德与琼阿梅尼冲突的最新细节。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-12/6a0249381fd29native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗马诺：穆帅和皇马进入深度谈判阶段；此事决定权在老佛爷手里</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.49" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260115/69681d8d7a897.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.49" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.49" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260115/69681d8d7a897.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260115/69681d8d7a897.jpg"> </div><p>名记罗马诺在Youtube频道更新视频，带来了穆里尼奥与皇马谈判执教的最新消息。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-12/6a01fc7ea80d6native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗马诺：内马尔已入选巴西初选大名单，能否去美加墨下周才会敲定</a></p><div class="img_wrap" dat