语权且权力架构要清晰</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.49" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260115/69681d8fb7586.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.49" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.49" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260115/69681d8fb7586.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260115/69681d8fb7586.jpg"> </div><p>阿斯报消息，穆帅对执教皇马有两大要求，虽然双方处在接触阶段，但是穆帅的两大要求已经明确，那就是引援方向的话语权和一个清晰的权力架构。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-12/6a02181c5cb43native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">知道你好这一口！巴萨夺冠巡游，有球迷给什琴斯尼扔来一包烟</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.8" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260512/202605120406581798.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260512/202605120406581798.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260512/202605120406581798.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">本周一，锁定西甲冠军的巴萨进行了夺冠游行。波兰双星莱万和什琴斯尼在巡游大巴上坐在一起，后者是一名烟民，而球迷们则投其所好。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-12